[0m21:20:22.674361 [debug] [Thread-4 (]: Re-using an available connection from the pool (formerly model.gn_dw_silver.BIGQUERY_EVENT, now model.gn_dw_silver.DIM_MARKETING_CAMPAIGN)
[0m21:20:22.674866 [debug] [Thread-4 (]: Began compiling node model.gn_dw_silver.DIM_MARKETING_CAMPAIGN
